  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen you are clicking on a Friend who you can just Join, the button order is `Join` (going to them) and then `Send Invite` (them coming to you). If you can't directly join a Friend (so you need to Request first) the order is `Send Invite` (them coming to you) and then `Request Invite` (you going to them).\nThis can be confusing since the order of the button to go to them or you inviting them to you changes depending on their Status / Instance they are in.\n# Suggestion:\nThe order for both should always be going to them first and then Inviting them to join you. (`Join`, `Send Invite` and `Request Invite`, `Send Invite`). \nThis would make the button order more consistent and would make it easier to just remember to for example always just press the first button if you want to go to them.\n# Attachments:\nIn the first picture you can see the order when you can just Join them and in the second one when you first need to Request an Invite:",
